# Capacity Analysis

Position-size sweep on the in-scope panel (Aave V3, Morpho Blue, Euler
V2). Slippage model: 0.5 × slope₁ × Δu (Kissell 2014 linear average
impact); slope₁ = 0.04 for all three protocols per published risk
parameters.

